cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Evidence-Grounded Agentic AI for Feedback-Guided Refinement of Parkinson's Disease Transcriptomic Biomarkers"
abstract: >-
  An LLM agent, governed by Model Context Protocol tools with deterministic guardrails,
  that compresses a 593-gene Parkinson's disease blood transcriptomic biomarker panel to
  279 genes while preserving development performance within a pre-registered tolerance and
  without any access to the held-out test set.
authors:
